LIBRARIES

The app is built with AndroidX, Jetpack Compose, Kotlin and kotlinx.serialization,
which are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The optional Shizuku auto-import uses the Shizuku API and provider (Rikka, Apache
License 2.0) and HiddenApiBypass (LSPosed, Apache License 2.0).

The idea of watching the clipboard through a Shizuku user service while Clash of
Clans is open comes from Clash Timers by memehammad (GPL-3.0,
https://github.com/memehammad/clash-timers). No code from that project is used:
the implementation here is written separately, which is why this project stays
under the MIT License.

The optional scroll motion blur (ui/ScrollBlur.kt) is modelled on the scroll motion blur
of Essentials by Sameera Sandakelum (https://github.com/sameerasw/essentials), MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2025 Sameera Sandakelum: the directional blur shader and the way
its length follows the scroll speed. It is a separate implementation.

The README buttons in docs/ show the Shizuku app icon (Rikka, Apache License 2.0)
and the Obtainium logo (ImranR98, GPL-3.0). Both belong to their projects and are
used only as links to them. They are not covered by the MIT License.
